        "id": "68140aea309a716aaba8aee1",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Big, beautiful property, we had 9 adults and 4 children and PLENTY of room to be comfortable! The pool was perfect for relaxing, but we were walking distance from the beach if we wanted to go. We were far enough off 30-A for the quiet but close enough to Seaside to be there in minutes. Can't thank the owners enough for sharing!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Not a home run but a grand slam!",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Katherine M.",
        "date": "2022-08-16T14:24:15Z",
        "id": "62fba890c76760138e708836",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Absolutely Loved this property and the time we stayed there. The property itself wad very clean, spacious and have no complaints whatsoever. We were a group of 13 people and there was still plenty of room left to fit more. It has a short walking distance to the beach which was a great plus specially with kids. The property manager was a sweetheart, made sure we were taken care of the whole time, super nice and easy to communicate with. Overall, we just have nice things to say about this property and will for sure come back!",
        "themes": [
